{"speciesId":357,"names":{"fr":"Tropius","es":"Tropius","en":"Tropius","ja":"トロピウス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"The bunches of fruit around TROPIUS’s neck are very popular with children. This POKéMON loves fruit, and eats it continuously. Apparently, its love for fruit resulted in its own outgrowth of fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Children of the southern tropics eat as snacks the fruit that grows in bunches around the neck of TROPIUS. This POKéMON flies by flapping the leaves on its back as if they were wings."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves. The bunch of fruit that grows around its neck is deliciously sweet. In the spring, it scatters pollen from its neck."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives in tropical jungles. The bunch of fruit around its neck is delicious. The fruit grows twice a year."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives in tropical jungles. The bunch of fruit around its neck is delicious. The fruit grows twice a year."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Because it continually ate only its favorite fruit, the fruit started growing around its neck."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Because it continually ate only its favorite fruit, the fruit started growing around its neck."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It’s a highly favored tropical snack."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It’s a highly favored tropical snack."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"À force de toujours manger le même fruit succulent, il en pousse à la base de son cou."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"À force de toujours manger le même fruit succulent, il en pousse à la base de son cou."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves and gives the sweet, delicious fruit around its neck to children."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves and gives the sweet, delicious fruit around its neck to children."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses grandes feuilles lui servent à voler. Il distribue les fruits qui pendent à son cou aux enfants, qui s’en régalent."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Puede volar al agitar sus grandes hojas. Reparte entre los niños la codiciada fruta dulce que crece de su cuello."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves and gives the sweet, delicious fruit around its neck to children."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな 葉っぱで 空を飛んで 子供たちに 大人気の 首に できる 甘い くだものを 配る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les succulents fruits de son cou poussent deux fois l’an et font le régal des enfants des tropiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Los racimos de su cuello dan fruto cada seis meses. A los niños de zonas tropicales les encanta su dulzor."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It’s a highly favored tropical snack."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"首の 房は １年に ２回 実を つける。甘くて おいしい。 南国の 子供の おやつだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les enfants adorent les fruits autour du cou de Tropius. Apparemment, son penchant pour les fruits l’a conduit à en faire pousser sur son propre corps. Il les aime tant qu’il en mange sans arrêt."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A los niños les encantan los racimos de fruta que Tropius tiene en el cuello. Este Pokémon siempre come fruta; le encanta. De hecho, ese parece ser el motivo por el que él mismo da fruta."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The bunches of fruit around Tropius’s neck are very popular with children. This Pokémon loves fruit, and eats it continuously. Apparently, its love for fruit resulted in its own outgrowth of fruit."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"首の フサは 甘くて 子どもに 大人気。 果物が 大好物で 食べ続けて いたら 首に 果物が できるように なったらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les enfants des tropiques mangent les fruits qui poussent autour du cou de Tropius pour leur goûter. Ce Pokémon peut voler en agitant les feuilles situées sur son dos, comme s’il s’agissait d’ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Los niños de la zona sur de los trópicos se comen los racimos de fruta que le crecen a Tropius alrededor del cuello. Este Pokémon vuela batiendo las hojas que tiene en el lomo como si fueran alas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Children of the southern tropics eat as snacks the fruit that grows in bunches around the neck of Tropius. This Pokémon flies by flapping the leaves on its back as if they were wings."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"南国の 子どもたちは トロピウスの 首に なった 果物の フサを おやつに 食べるよ。 背中の 葉っぱを 羽ばたかせて 空を 飛ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les fruits qui poussent sur le cou des Tropius d’Alola sont si doux qu’ils surclassent ceux des autres régions."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Los frutos que crecen en el cuello del Tropius de la región de Alola son mucho más dulces y ricos que los de otros lugares."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The bunches of fruit growing around the necks of Tropius in Alola are especially sweet compared to those in other regions."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アローラに棲む トロピウスの 首に 実る フサは 他の 地方より 格別に 甘くて もう最高。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Dans les régions où il fait chaud, on trouve des fermes dédiées à l’élevage de ce Pokémon, très apprécié pour les fruits poussant sur son cou."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A la gente le encanta la deliciosa fruta de sus racimos. En las regiones cálidas abundan las granjas que se dedican a criar Tropius."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Bunches of delicious fruit grow around its neck. In warm areas, many ranches raise Tropius."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"首の フサが 美味しくて 人気。 暖かい 土地には トロピウスを 育てる 牧場が たくさん。"}],"varieties":[{"id":357,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[5,"level-up",27],[6,"level-up",27],[7,"level-up",27],[8,"level-up",27],[9,"level-up",27],[10,"level-up",27],[11,"level-up",27],[12,"level-up",27],[13,"level-up",27],[14,"level-up",27],[15,"level-up",27],[16,"level-up",21],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[23,"level-up",